<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-PK">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="description" content="Learn about Nishat Institute of Medical Science and Technology in Chiniot, Punjab, including our director, mission, and vision for healthcare education.">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta property="og:title" content="About Nishat Institute | Chiniot, Pakistan">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Our story, educational mission, and vision for healthcare education in Chiniot.">
    <meta property="og:locale" content="en_PK">
    <link rel="canonical" href="<%= siteOrigin %>/about">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/public-pages.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/public-theme.css">
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include("_site-header", { active: "about" }) %>
    <main>
      <section class="page-hero about-page-hero">
        <span class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE COLLEGE</span>
        <h1>Medical education with purpose.</h1>
        <p>Nishat Institute of Medical Science and Technology helps students prepare for meaningful work in healthcare.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="director-message-section">
        <figure class="director-portrait">
          <img src="/images/director/IMG-20260923-WA0020.jpg" alt="Nishat Akhtar, Director of Nishat Institute of Medical Science and Technology" width="960" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <figcaption>
            <strong>Nishat Akhtar</strong>
            <span>Director, Nishat Institute of Medical Science and Technology</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="director-message-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">A MESSAGE FROM OUR DIRECTOR</span>
          <h2>Welcome to Nishat Institute of Medical Science and Technology.</h2>
          <p>It is my pleasure to welcome you to Nishat Institute of Medical Science and Technology. Choosing a path in healthcare is a meaningful commitment, and we are proud to support students as they begin that journey.</p>
          <p>We are committed to quality education that combines strong academic foundations with practical learning. Our aim is to help every student understand the responsibilities of healthcare and develop the knowledge needed to serve with confidence.</p>
          <p>Discipline, professionalism, and ethical conduct are essential in this field. We encourage our students to approach their studies with dedication, respect their responsibilities, and treat every person with compassion.</p>
          <p>Our vision is to develop competent healthcare professionals who continue learning throughout their careers. We are committed to each student’s academic and personal growth, and to building an institution that contributes positively to the future of healthcare and society.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="institution-section">
        <div class="institution-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE INSTITUTION</span>
          <h2>Build knowledge. Grow with purpose.</h2>
          <p>Nishat Institute of Medical Science and Technology was established to support students pursuing meaningful careers in healthcare. Its educational philosophy brings academic depth together with discipline, practical preparation, and a strong sense of professional responsibility.</p>
          <p>Our academic environment is focused on healthcare education and student development. We aim to provide clear program information, supportive guidance, and learning experiences that help students grow into capable and compassionate professionals.</p>
          <a class="button-primary" href="/courses">Explore our programs <span>→</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mission-vision-section" aria-label="Our mission and vision">
        <article>
          <span class="eyebrow">OUR MISSION</span>
          <h2>Our Mission</h2>
          <p>To provide a disciplined, supportive, and academically strong environment that prepares students for meaningful careers in healthcare.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="eyebrow">OUR VISION</span>
          <h2>Our Vision</h2>
          <p>To pursue excellence in education, professionalism, ethical practice, service to society, and continuous learning.</p>
        </article>
      </section>
    </main>
    <%- include("_site-footer") %>
  </body>
</html>
